flowchart TD
    Start["Initialize w0, w1\nrandomly"] --> Forward["Forward Pass\nCompute predictions\nh(x) = w0 + w1*x"]
    Forward --> Cost["Compute Cost\nMSE = 1/2n Σ(h(x) - y)²"]
    Cost --> Gradient["Compute Gradient\n∂J/∂w0, ∂J/∂w1"]
    Gradient --> Update["Update Parameters\nw := w - α * gradient"]
    Update --> Check{"Converged?\nCost change < ε"}
    Check -->|No| Forward
    Check -->|Yes| Done["Optimal w0, w1\nLine of Best Fit"]

    style Start fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000
    style Cost fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,color:#000
    style Update fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000
    style Done fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c62828,color:#000,stroke-width:2px
